00:33:25.340 --> 00:33:26.703
ask directly.

00:33:27.940 --> 00:33:30.140
- So thank you very much
for, for highlighting

00:33:30.140 --> 00:33:32.640
the structural constraints that exists

00:33:32.640 --> 00:33:35.150
on everybody's responses.

00:33:35.150 --> 00:33:37.810
I was really quite kind
