00:33:37.810 --> 00:33:39.270
in how, the degree to which,

00:33:39.270 --> 00:33:42.350
for instance, young people lead the charge

00:33:45.876 --> 00:33:47.760
in changing the world,

00:33:47.760 --> 00:33:50.310
so the example that you gave
of the driver for instance,

00:33:50.310 --> 00:33:52.280
is that a younger driver

00:33:52.280 --> 00:33:53.113
that

00:33:54.580 --> 00:33:57.820
decides to, to move forward, for instance?

00:33:57.820 --> 00:34:00.670
Have you had any kind of like insight

00:34:00.670 --> 00:34:03.970
