00:34:05.220 --> 00:34:06.053
if you don't mind me asking?

00:34:06.053 --> 00:34:07.920
I know it's an off the wall question

00:34:07.920 --> 00:34:09.360
but I'm really kind of interested

00:34:09.360 --> 00:34:14.360
in how young people
themselves just either step up

00:34:14.810 --> 00:34:15.643
or

00:34:18.130 --> 00:34:20.990
how, yeah, how, like
maybe they, they start,

00:34:20.990 --> 00:34:24.620
they step up to change the
world or refuse to do so,

00:34:24.620 --> 00:34:27.270
depending on the generation.

00:34:27.270 --> 00:34:28.900
- Absolutely, thanks Catherine.

00:34:28.900 --> 00:34:32.290
So in the case of the
Baddawi Camp Cultural Club,

00:34:32.290 --> 00:34:35.760
it is a youth organization,
so it's an organization

00:34:35.760 --> 00:34:38.080
that caters for young people in the camp

00:34:39.010 --> 00:34:43.200
but a large number of the
people who organize events,

00:34:43.200 --> 00:34:48.190
et cetera, are themselves
UNRWA teachers or UNRWA staff,

00:34:48.190 --> 00:34:50.750
who are dissatisfied

00:34:50.750 --> 00:34:53.430
with the extent to which
UNRWA itself is able

00:34:53.430 --> 00:34:57.790
or willing to address particular
gaps and therefore takes it

00:34:57.790 --> 00:35:00.070
as a responsibility to, to fill those gaps

00:35:00.070 --> 00:35:01.680
in different ways,

00:35:01.680 --> 00:35:06.400
so here we have young people
certainly, being very active

00:35:06.400 --> 00:35:08.210
but also working in collaboration

00:35:08.210 --> 00:35:11.230
with members of the, of the community

00:35:11.230 --> 00:35:13.390
who wouldn't traditionally
be conceptualized

00:35:13.390 --> 00:35:15.750
as part of the younger
generation let's say,

00:35:15.750 --> 00:35:18.730
so there are different age
groups working together

00:35:18.730 --> 00:35:20.850
and there are also different
initiatives taking place.

00:35:20.850 --> 00:35:23.637
So here I focused in, on,
on the, on the cultural club

00:35:23.637 --> 00:35:27.720
but there are also different
initiatives taking place,

00:35:27.720 --> 00:35:29.970
including through, through the mosque,

00:35:29.970 --> 00:35:32.790
which again would, through
