00:38:13.890 --> 00:38:15.670
that they can fill those gaps,

00:38:15.670 --> 00:38:18.480
often on through horizontal cooperation.

00:38:18.480 --> 00:38:20.390
So one of the initiatives
that I highlighted there,

00:38:20.390 --> 00:38:22.410
yes, has transnational support

00:38:22.410 --> 00:38:25.060
