Youth Center working together

00:38:36.330 --> 00:38:38.530
to identify what are the common struggles

00:38:38.530 --> 00:38:40.360
that we're facing across the camps

00:38:40.360 --> 00:38:43.620
and how can we work together
with that transnational support

00:38:43.620 --> 00:38:48.620
to support the, the residents
of these camps situations.

00:38:49.120 --> 00:38:51.120
Of course, there are many
