00:38:51.120 --> 00:38:54.330
to have access to those systems

00:38:54.330 --> 00:38:55.840
and those structures of power

00:38:55.840 --> 00:38:57.740
and who will be applying for jobs

00:38:57.740 --> 00:39:02.220
