alternative mode of operating

00:39:29.590 --> 00:39:31.210
which doesn't just perpetuate

00:39:31.210 --> 00:39:34.310
the humanitarian system itself.

00:39:34.310 --> 00:39:35.842
So

00:39:35.842 --> 00:39:37.190
I'm really looking forward to hearing more

00:39:37.190 --> 00:39:41.160
